Read the frontend tool versions (`typescript`, `vitest`, `@testing-library/react`, `release-it` and `mrs-developer`) in the `add-ons/frontend` template straight from `config.versions`, instead of duplicating their values in `__version_*` computed properties that the repository config could never actually influence. Drop the unused `config.versions.tools_pre_commit` pin, and add tests that every declared pin is consumed by a template and that this repository's own workflows use the versions it ships. Require the final `cookieplone` 2.0.0 release instead of the 2.0.0b3 beta. @ericof
